<div class="passage-shell" data-scene="deliveries" data-typing="false"><div class="scene-hero" role="img" aria-label="A delivery van filled with cardboard parcels."></div><p class="photo-credit">Photo: <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/brown-cardboard-boxes-inside-the-van-6169662/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tima Miroshnichenko / Pexels</a></p><div class="story-copy"><p class="kicker"></p><h1>Jamie’s next order</h1>(if: $clearDesign is true)[<h2>Ending: Jamie can choose and cancel easily</h2>](else:)[<h2>Ending: Jamie receives another unwanted order</h2>]<div class="choices">
[[Play again and explore another path->Start]]
[[Read the ACM connections->Ethics]]
[[Picture and sound references->Credits]]
</div></div></div>


