:: ProductReview {"position":"1025,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="passage-shell" data-scene="office" data-typing="false"><div class="scene-hero" role="img" aria-label="An empty modern office at Amaze."></div><p class="photo-credit">Photo: <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/an-empty-office-5483236/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cottonbro studio / Pexels</a></p><div class="story-copy"><p class="kicker"></p><h1>What should change?</h1><div class="choices">
